@HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Health Check
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Products Catalog
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Low Stock Alerts
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/inventory/low-stock
Accept: application/json

### Orders History
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/orders
Accept: application/json
